-- The courses that shipped in the app as TypeScript until 0.6.0, moved into
-- public.courses. Inserting them runs the catalog trigger, which fills
-- learning_paths, skills, lessons, challenges and projects with the same ids
-- the old catalog used, so nobody loses progress. Rows that already exist are
-- left alone: after this migration the database is where courses are edited.

on conflict (id) do nothing;
